  - African Natural Products Database
abstract: >-
  Atom-resolved mapping of electrophilic motifs across the African Natural Products
  Database, with local-fragment addition energies calibrated against source-verified
  glutathione rate constants, per-family evidence grading, an explicit applicability
  domain, and fragment-fidelity diagnostics on every released site estimate.
